.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH dotman-log 1  "log "
.SH NAME
dotman\-log \- Show the repo\*(Aqs history
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBdotman log\fR [\fB\-n\fR|\fB\-\-max\-count\fR] [\fB\-v\fR|\fB\-\-verbose\fR] [\fB\-q\fR|\fB\-\-quiet\fR] [\fB\-\-no\-pager\fR] [\fB\-\-allow\-root\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fIPATHS\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Show the repo\*(Aqs history
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-n\fR, \fB\-\-max\-count\fR \fI<N>\fR
Show at most this many commits
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
[\fIPATHS\fR]
Files, directories or globs to filter by; a trailing `/` means the whole subtree
.SH "GLOBAL OPTIONS"
.TP
\fB\-v\fR, \fB\-\-verbose\fR
Show verbose output
.TP
\fB\-q\fR, \fB\-\-quiet\fR
Suppress informational messages
.TP
\fB\-\-no\-pager\fR
Disable pager output
.TP
\fB\-\-allow\-root\fR
Allow running as root
